{"id":"en-r-5gfir9.de","jokeId":"en-r-5gfir9","locale":"de","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Set up the German dad-joke pattern 'Hallo Hunger, ich bin Papa' first, so 'Hallo Schwul' reads as the compulsive repeat; the mother's warning replaces the stare and the fist.","title":"Papa kann nicht anders","location":"gostinaya","cast":["paren","zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"paren":"son","zhena":"mother","muzhik":"father"},"lines":[{"character":"paren","text":"Papa, ich hab Hunger.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hallo Hunger, ich bin Papa.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Nicht schon wieder.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Mama, Papa, ich muss euch was sagen.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Ich bin schwul.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"zhena","text":"Wag es ja nicht!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich sag doch gar nichts.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ich seh es dir an. Lass es!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Hallo Schwul, ich bin Papa!","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7rh7qn.en","jokeId":"en-r-7rh7qn","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Turned the gesture into spoken lines: the waiter hands over his gun and badge like a movie cop.","title":"Gun and Badge","location":"bar","cast":["barmen","nachalnik"],"roles":{"barmen":"waiter","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"You're fired.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"I knew this day would come.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Here. My gun. And my badge.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"You're a waiter. Where did you even get those?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7rh7qn.ru","jokeId":"en-r-7rh7qn","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Direct translation; the gesture became the waiter's spoken lines.","title":"Пистолет и значок","location":"bar","cast":["barmen","nachalnik"],"roles":{"barmen":"waiter","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Ты уволен.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Я знал, что этот день настанет.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Вот. Мой пистолет. И значок.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Ты же официант. Откуда у тебя это?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7rh7qn.de","jokeId":"en-r-7rh7qn","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Direct translation; the gesture became the waiter's spoken lines.","title":"Waffe und Marke","location":"bar","cast":["barmen","nachalnik"],"roles":{"barmen":"waiter","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Du bist gefeuert.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ich wusste, dass dieser Tag kommt.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Hier. Meine Waffe. Und meine Marke.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Du bist Kellner. Woher hast du die überhaupt?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-f9f6q6.en","jokeId":"en-r-f9f6q6","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Turned the first-person story into a firing scene; added the boss so the reveal 'cremation or burial' is a character's line instead of narration.","title":"Smoking or Non-Smoking","location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"You're fired.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Why? I'm always polite with the customers!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"You ask every single one of them: smoking or non-smoking?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"It's a simple question!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Here we say cremation or burial!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-f9f6q6.ru","jokeId":"en-r-f9f6q6","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated as a firing scene with the boss; 'для курящих или для некурящих' keeps the restaurant phrasing.","title":"Для курящих","location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Ты уволен.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"За что? Я со всеми клиентами вежлив!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Ты каждого спрашиваешь: вам для курящих или для некурящих?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Нормальный же вопрос!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"У нас говорят: кремация или погребение!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-f9f6q6.de","jokeId":"en-r-f9f6q6","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Translated as a firing scene; 'Feuerbestattung oder Erdbestattung' is the natural German pair and echoes the smoking idea.","title":"Raucher oder Nichtraucher","location":"ulitsa","cast":["paren","nachalnik"],"roles":{"paren":"employee","nachalnik":"boss"},"lines":[{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Du bist gefeuert.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"paren","text":"Warum? Ich bin zu allen Kunden höflich!","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Du fragst jeden Einzelnen: Raucher oder Nichtraucher?","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Ist doch eine ganz normale Frage!","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"nachalnik","text":"Bei uns heißt das Feuerbestattung oder Erdbestattung!","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-83q9rz.en","jokeId":"en-r-83q9rz","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Kept the dialogue as is; the customer walks in on his first line.","title":"The Wifi Password","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"What's the wifi password?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik"]},{"character":"barmen","text":"You need to buy a drink first.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Okay. I'll have a coke.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Is Pepsi okay?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Sure. How much?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Three dollars.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"There you go. So what's the wifi password?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"barmen","text":"You need to buy a drink first. No spaces, all lowercase.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-83q9rz.ru","jokeId":"en-r-83q9rz","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"The condition sentence still works as a password; dollars became roubles.","title":"Пароль от вайфая","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Какой пароль от вайфая?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik"]},{"character":"barmen","text":"Сначала надо что-нибудь заказать.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ладно. Мне колу.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Пепси пойдёт?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Пойдёт. Сколько?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Двести рублей.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Держите. Так какой пароль от вайфая?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"barmen","text":"Сначала надо что-нибудь заказать. Слитно, маленькими буквами.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-83q9rz.de","jokeId":"en-r-83q9rz","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"The condition sentence still works as a password; dollars became euros.","title":"Das WLAN-Passwort","location":"bar","cast":["muzhik","barmen"],"roles":{"muzhik":"customer","barmen":"bartender"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Wie ist das WLAN-Passwort?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["muzhik"]},{"character":"barmen","text":"Sie müssen erst was bestellen.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Okay. Eine Cola, bitte.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Ist Pepsi okay?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Klar. Was macht das?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"barmen","text":"Drei Euro.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Bitte schön. Also, wie ist das WLAN-Passwort?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"barmen","text":"Sie müssen erst was bestellen. Ohne Leerzeichen, alles klein.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-aji6wu.en","jokeId":"en-r-aji6wu","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Added a solemn opener so the confession lands as a big reveal before the deflation.","title":"War Stories","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Son, sit down. It's time you knew the truth.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"In Iraq, I killed fifteen people.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Dad, you were a helicopter mechanic.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Never said I was a good one.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-aji6wu.ru","jokeId":"en-r-aji6wu","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; the son's line names the job as 'repairing helicopters' so the punch can echo the verb.","title":"Военные истории","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Сынок, сядь. Пора тебе узнать правду.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"В Ираке я убил пятнадцать человек.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Пап, ты же там вертолёты чинил.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"А я не говорил, что хорошо чинил.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-aji6wu.de","jokeId":"en-r-aji6wu","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation with a solemn opener.","title":"Kriegsgeschichten","location":"gostinaya","cast":["muzhik","paren"],"roles":{"muzhik":"father","paren":"son"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik","text":"Setz dich, mein Sohn. Es ist Zeit für die Wahrheit.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Im Irak habe ich fünfzehn Menschen getötet.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"paren","text":"Papa, du warst Hubschraubermechaniker.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Ich hab nie gesagt, dass ich ein guter war.","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-dswgsp.en","jokeId":"en-r-dswgsp","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"Narrator dropped: the friend tells the joke on screen; the stranger delivers the punchline as he gets off the bus (exit).","title":"The Man Behind Us","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","ded"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend","ded":"old-man"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Want a joke? What do you do if you see an epileptic having a fit in the bath?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"What?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Throw in your laundry.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"ded","text":"I think that's disgusting.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"My son died in the bath while having a fit.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Oh no. We're so sorry, sir.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Really. We're sorry.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"ded","text":"He choked on a sock.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["ded"]}]}
{"id":"en-r-dswgsp.ru","jokeId":"en-r-dswgsp","locale":"ru","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; the stranger delivers the punchline and gets off (exit).","title":"Сосед по автобусу","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","ded"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend","ded":"old-man"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Анекдот хочешь? Что делать, если у эпилептика припадок в ванне?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Что?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Закинуть туда бельё.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"ded","text":"Как вам не стыдно.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Мой сын умер в ванне во время припадка.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Простите, ради бога.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Мы правда не знали.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"ded","text":"Он подавился носком.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["ded"]}]}
{"id":"en-r-dswgsp.de","jokeId":"en-r-dswgsp","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Close translation; the stranger delivers the punchline and gets off (exit).","title":"Der Mann hinter uns","location":"doroga","cast":["muzhik","muzhik-sosed","ded"],"roles":{"muzhik":"everyman","muzhik-sosed":"friend","ded":"old-man"},"lines":[{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Kennst du den? Was macht man, wenn ein Epileptiker in der Badewanne einen Anfall hat?","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Was?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Man wirft die Wäsche rein.","emotion":"happy","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"ded","text":"Das finde ich widerlich.","emotion":"angry","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"ded","text":"Mein Sohn ist bei einem Anfall in der Badewanne gestorben.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Oh nein. Das tut uns furchtbar leid.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik-sosed","text":"Wirklich, entschuldigen Sie.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"ded","text":"Er ist an einer Socke erstickt.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8,"exit":["ded"]}]}
{"id":"en-r-7cvial.en","jokeId":"en-r-7cvial","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"The overhearing narrator is dropped; the shopper is a woman in the source, so zhena (mother shopping for her family) replaces the suggested muzhik; she walks in to the stock boy.","title":"Bigger Turkeys","location":"magazin","cast":["zhena","paren"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"zhena","text":"Excuse me, young man.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["zhena"]},{"character":"zhena","text":"I need a turkey for Thanksgiving, but these are all too small for my family.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"zhena","text":"Do these turkeys get any bigger?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"No, ma'am. They're dead.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7cvial.ru","jokeId":"en-r-7cvial","locale":"ru","adaptation":"reworked","notes":"Thanksgiving became New Year; 'Они побольше будут?' can mean 'will you have bigger ones' or 'will they get bigger', and the clerk takes the second reading.","title":"Индейка на Новый год","location":"magazin","cast":["zhena","paren"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"zhena","text":"Молодой человек!","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["zhena"]},{"character":"zhena","text":"Мне индейку на Новый год, на всю семью. А тут одни маленькие.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"zhena","text":"Они побольше будут?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"Нет. Они уже не вырастут. Они мёртвые.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-7cvial.de","jokeId":"en-r-7cvial","locale":"de","adaptation":"direct","notes":"Thanksgiving became Christmas; 'Werden die noch größer?' keeps both readings.","title":"Größere Truthähne","location":"magazin","cast":["zhena","paren"],"roles":{"zhena":"mother","paren":"employee"},"lines":[{"character":"zhena","text":"Entschuldigung, junger Mann.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3,"enter":["zhena"]},{"character":"zhena","text":"Ich brauche einen Truthahn für Weihnachten, aber die sind alle zu klein für meine Familie.","emotion":"sad","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"zhena","text":"Werden die noch größer?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"paren","text":"Nein. Die sind tot.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
{"id":"en-r-b03ncg.en","jokeId":"en-r-b03ncg","locale":"en","adaptation":"original","notes":"One narrator line sets up the phone call so both can be on screen; the husband's 'How about now?' stays the punchline.","title":"Voodoo Doll","location":"ofis","cast":["zhena","muzhik"],"roles":{"zhena":"wife","muzhik":"husband"},"lines":[{"character":"narrator","text":"A husband calls his wife at work.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Honey, quick question.","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.3},{"character":"muzhik","text":"Do you ever get a shooting pain across your body? Like someone has a voodoo doll of you and they're stabbing it?","emotion":"neutral","pauseAfterSec":0.4},{"character":"zhena","text":"No. Why? Are you okay?","emotion":"surprised","pauseAfterSec":0.8},{"character":"muzhik","text":"How about now?","emotion":"smug","pauseAfterSec":0.8}]}
